We've just released #HedgeDoc 1.12.1 🎉

We recommend updating soon as we include a lot of security fixes in this release.

This includes (among others):
- A DoS attack for instances via authenticated users
- A fix for data loss while having connection problems
- A fix to handle checkbox toogeling correctly

Read the full changelog on https://hedgedoc.org/releases/1.12.1/
